SCOPE

This licence covers the original source code in this repository: everything
under src/, the build configuration, and the documentation.

It does NOT cover the game content under public/assets/ — sprites, tilemaps,
sound effects, music — or the transcribed datatables under src/data/. Those are
derived from Wizball (Ocean Software / Sensible Software, 1987) and from the
Retrospec C++ remake, and remain the property of their respective owners. They
are included here for a non-commercial port and are not licensed for reuse by
this file. See the "Licence" section of README.md.
